{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事にバースデーライブ終わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいたまスーパーアリーナはやっぱりすっごく広いな〜と感じました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん人が入れるようスタジアムモードで、\nバックステージの音席にも沢山の方が来てくださってて、アンコールの煽りではそちらの客席に行かせていただいたのですがアリーナから5階席の方々に負けないぐらいバックステージも盛り上がっていて\n沢山名前を呼んでくださって嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部届きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽後のみんなもハイテンションで元気いっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてバースデーライブ初日は大好きな\nななみんの卒業ライブでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期の頃から一緒にいて寮の頃は当たり前のように一緒に生活をしてたのでなんだか実感がわきません..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCでも言いましたが夜遅くまで生物や数学を理解できるまで図に書いて最初から最後まで丁寧に教えてくれてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんだけでなく英語はまいやんに教えてもらったり、いくちゃんにも教えてもらったことあったな〜\n生駒ちゃんも教えてくれるって来てくれたけど解けてなかったなぁ。。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんにも教えてもらった！ひなちまにも教えてもらった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんもマネージャーさんも\n周りにいるみーんなに教えてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも夜な夜な、仕事の合間に教えてくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の握手会！ななみんのとこにこっそり駆け寄ったら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみが気配を感じ始め..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チラッ！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づかれちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんとは何度か焼き鳥屋さんに行ったのが思い出深いな...食べるものが全部一緒だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食の好みが合うんです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいな( › ·̮ ‹ )\nななみんが与えてくれたものは大きくて大切な存在です。ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから違う道を歩むことになるけどお互い頑張ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の素敵な時間を過ごせて幸せ！本当にななみんありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タオルやうちわ見えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです！！！\n乃木團でバンドもできて最高でした！\n今回は6人揃っては出来ませんでしたがひめたんの強い気持ちも一緒にメンバー心１つに演奏しました！\n早く6人でバンドしたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/26/1527479/0016.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}